version: "1.0.0"

date-released: "2026-08-03"

abstract: >
  Chess of the Angels is a chess variant designed for the era
  of human-AI collaboration. It introduces a 68-square board,
  four Angel Wing squares, two Angel pieces per player,
  a mandatory preliminary opening move and a conditional
  territorial activation mechanism. The project includes
  the official rulebook, registered board and piece designs,
  diagrams and technical specifications for computational
  implementation, including the planned AFEN notation,
  state-space model and reference engine documentation.

